WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.826
Fixed points, robustly hard.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.806
Finding equilibria is hard. Does it stay

3
00:00:04.806 --> 00:00:06.811
hard if some answers may be wrong?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.146
Paths become coded curves that survive errors,

5
00:00:11.146 --> 00:00:13.492
so near answers still find an end.

6
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.908
Claimed: yes, with little blow-up.

7
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.198
Manuscript only, no Lean.
